Task 1: Business Domain Selection

Selected Domain: Education

The education sector is increasingly adopting digital platforms for learning, communication, and student support. With the rise of online classes, learning management systems, and student feedback channels, large volumes of textual data are generated daily.

This domain is particularly suitable for AI-driven solutions because:

There is a continuous flow of student queries, feedback, and complaints
Manual handling of this data is time-consuming and inconsistent
There is a strong need to improve student experience and response time

An AI-based solution in the education domain can help institutions better understand student needs, automate support systems, and make data-driven decisions to enhance learning outcomes.
